          </p>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <label style="display: block; color: #f8fafc; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              Export Format
            </label>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
              <label style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;">
                <input type="radio" name="format" value="zip" checked style="margin-top: 3px; accent-color: #38bdf8;" onchange="updateExportWalkthroughFormat('zip')" />
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9em; color: #f8fafc; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-file-archive" style="color: #f59e0b;"></i> Package Archive (.zip)
                  </div>
                  <div style="font-size: 0.8em; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 2px;">
                    Portable ZIP bundle containing all recordings (.cast), videos, notes (.md), and referenced pictures.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </label>

              <label style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;">
                <input type="radio" name="format" value="pdf" style="margin-top: 3px; accent-color: #38bdf8;" onchange="updateExportWalkthroughFormat('pdf')" />
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9em; color: #f8fafc; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-file-pdf" style="color: #ef4444;"></i> Unified Document (.pdf)
                  </div>
                  <div style="font-size: 0.8em; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 2px;">
                    All walkthrough steps compiled into a single styled PDF document with table of contents and pictures.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <label for="export-filename" style="display: block; color: #f8fafc; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">
